Description:It is your second main phase. You control Blind Hunter (haunt; when it enters or the creature it haunts dies, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2) and Grizzly Bears, and have two Flings in hand with four red mana floating. The opponent is at 6 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-haunt-order | Haunt exiles the dying card haunting target creature, and its effect happens again when the haunted creature dies (CR 702.55a-c): Fling Blind Hunter (2), haunt your Grizzly Bears, then Fling the Bears (2) for the second drain of 2; Fling the Bears first and the Hunter can only haunt the Arbiter, for 4 in total
